*The word "as"*
In English and Russian these are basically prepositions
English "as" [az]/[ez]
Russian "kak"
In Hindi phrase "treat me as your friend" the preposition is translated as=
=20
"k=C4=93 r=C5=ABpa m=C4=93=E1=B9=81" [kerupmem]

Wiktionary treats this meaning as "in the manner or role specified"
